# Summon (Lesser Circle) — a small familiar answers.
# D Phrygian dominant, 150 BPM: a quick plucked D major arpeggio up to D6, a chip
# bell ringing on the top, and the b2 grace note (Eb) of her sigh before it.

song Lesser Summon
tempo 150 4
echo 0.2 0.3 0.25

inst pluck
  vol 11 9 8 7 6 5 4 3 2 1 0
  duty 1 0
inst bell
  vol 11 10 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5 5 4 4 4 3 3 3 2 2 2 2 1 1 1 1 0
  arp | 0 19 12 24
  duty 2
inst tinkle
  vol 5 3 2 1 0
  duty 1

drum h tinkle C8

pattern lesser 12
  p1 pluck | D5 F#5 A5 Eb6 D6 . . . . . . = |
  p2 bell | . . . . D5 . . . . . . = |
  noi | h . h . h:8 . . . . . . . |

order
  lesser
